# X6-12 / W04 / O01 / O02 / O10 / T1 terminal-only debug-contract / I05 / I06
#
# The receiver clamps terminal retention to at least 60 seconds and mysqltest
# cannot issue an authenticated QUERY_EPOCH_STATUS frame.  The cnf therefore
# enables narrow debug-only COMMIT-query and receiver reaper-clock hooks.  They
# establish one
# authenticated COMMITTED query before expiry, pause the source, advance the
# receiver reaper through terminal/accepted retention, and reissue the same
# authenticated query.  The first query observes one retained READY W04 epoch;
# the future-clock reaper must release its prepared/cache/memory state back to
# baseline before returning NOT_FOUND.  All waits are bounded; this test never
# waits out the production 60-second retention interval.  The fail-hard
# projection preflight prevents a missing NOT_FOUND metric from timing out as a
# generic wait failure.

--let $terminal_cas_case= 3
--source suite/preserve_trx_transfer_stby/include/run_terminal_cas_w01.inc
